				<div id="mw-content-text" lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr"><div class="mw-parser-output"><h1><span id="Arduino_IDE_Installation_Steps(for_Windows)"></span><span class="mw-headline" id="Arduino_IDE_Installation_Steps.28for_Windows.29">Arduino IDE Installation Steps(for Windows)</span></h1>
<p>Download <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external text" href="../../www.arduino.cc/en/software">Arduino IDE</a><br />
Click to download<br />
<a href="./File_Arduino-ide-1.png" class="image"><img alt="Arduino-ide-1.png" src="../w/upload/6/63/Arduino-ide-1.png" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="906" height="383" /></a><br />
After the download, open it, click "Install" and click "Next"<br />
<a href="./File_Arduino-ide-2.png" class="image"><img alt="Arduino-ide-2.png" src="../w/upload/b/b9/Arduino-ide-2.png" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="746" height="967" /></a><br />
<a href="./File_Arduino-ide-3.png" class="image"><img alt="Arduino-ide-3.png" src="../w/upload/4/48/Arduino-ide-3.png" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="749" height="968" /></a><br />
When the installation is almost complete, it will pop up to install the USB driver, click "Install"<br />
<a href="./File_Arduino-ide-4.png" class="image"><img alt="Arduino-ide-4.png" src="../w/upload/4/45/Arduino-ide-4.png" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="454" height="486" /></a><br />
The installation is complete, the desktop generates a shortcut to open, double-click to open and then pop up the arduino IDE software<br />
<a href="./File_Arduino-ide-5.png" class="image"><img alt="Arduino-ide-5.png" src="../w/upload/3/32/Arduino-ide-5.png" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="753" height="408" /></a><br />
</p>
